  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A sample of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"n\"></span> moles of an ideal gas is kept at a constant volume. The graph shows how the pressure <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"P\"></span> of the gas varies with absolute temperature <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"T\"></span>.</p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure></p>\n<p>What is the volume of the gas?</p>\n<p>[1]</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"nR\\frac{T_{2}-T_{1}}{P_{2}-P_{1}}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"nR\\frac{P_{2}-P_{1}}{T_{2}-T_{1}}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"nR\\frac{T_{2}}{P_{2}}-\\frac{T_{1}}{P_{1}}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"nR\\frac{P_{2}}{T_{2}}-\\frac{P_{1}}{T_{1}}\"></span></li></ol>"
  },
